              "line": 90,
              "text": "`MIN_ZERO_TRIPLE + COMMON_DEPTH = LOSSLESS_NATIVE_SLICE_COORDINATE`."
            },
            {
              "line": 92,
              "text": "The local bridge is exact at this coordinate/readout strength. The **complete global bridge** from arbitrary signed X6 states, rotations, all six line families, chart orientations, the sixteen non-STAR coordinate selections, channels and time-dependent carrier data remains open."
